    "uprightMessage": "You need a stretch of quiet. This isn't avoidance — you're completing something that can only happen alone. There's a lamp inside you, and its light isn't for illuminating a crowd but the path just in front of your feet. Walking alone isn't the same as being lonely; sometimes one person goes deeper.",
