    "uprightMessage": "You've heard a voice calling you — not from outside, but from your own depths. You have walked through the darkest night and thought everything was finished. And there, at the very bottom, something began to revive. This isn't starting over after an ending; it's the whole of you moving up a level. Answer the call. You are ready.",
