    "uprightMessage": "You've walked a long way, from the Fool's cliff edge all the way here. You're standing at the end of one cycle and the start of the next. You don't have to be perfect to have completed something — you only have to be here, whole, with everything you've been through, your scars and what you learned. You are already enough. The next journey will come. For now, dance.",
