    "aromaGuide": "Peppermint with clary sage — the peppermint matches your quick tempo with clarity, the clary sage keeps the heart soft at speed.",
    "dailyPractice": "Eat one meal today deliberately slower than usual, chewing each mouthful twenty times before swallowing. Not to change you, but to let you feel the richness in a slowed-down world that you usually pass by.",
    "awarenessNote": "Speed is like river water. On a wide, level bed it runs fast and steady; force the same volume through a narrow channel and it becomes a flood. Your energy is abundant. The point isn't to slow it but to give it a wide enough channel, so it carries you rather than sweeping you away.",
