    "jungianAnalysis": "The explorer archetype enters unknown territory with pure curiosity, gifted at seeing possibilities others pass over. Its shadow is staying forever at the starting line, using \"still exploring\" to avoid real commitment. The work of individuation is grounding curiosity — moving from aimless excitement to a passion with roots.",
