    "jungianAnalysis": "The visionary leader is the archetype that turns personal will into collective direction, capable of making one idea into a movement. Its shadow is an inability to tolerate dissent — Beech's criticism reads \"different\" as \"wrong\". The discipline of individuation is recognising plurality not as a threat to order but as the piece that makes the vision complete.",
