    "flowerSpectrum": "Star of Bethlehem is the gentlest healer among the Bach essences, made for the aftershocks of shock and trauma. Whether the loss is recent or long ago, this flower is like a pair of soft hands telling your heart: you're safe now; you can open slowly.",
