    "jungianAnalysis": "The innocent's gift is a sensitivity uncontaminated by worldliness, able to receive the finest emotional signals. Its shadow is refusing to learn from experience — the same lesson recurring and going unseen, the Chestnut Bud loop. The work of individuation is looking back with an innocent heart, so every experience is actually digested.",
    "flowerSpectrum": "When you know you've walked this road before and can't help repeating it, circling in the same emotional pattern, Chestnut Bud keeps you company as a new clue appears inside the loop, and experience becomes wisdom.",
