    "uprightMessage": "Your heart is like a deep sea, able to hold everyone's feelings without being drowned. You know instinctively what people need — a look, a sentence, and someone feels caught. That empathy is your most tender gift, and you deserve to keep a share of the same tenderness for yourself.",
    "reversedReminder": "When care turns into control, love suffocates. Are you packaging \"you can't leave me\" as \"it's for your own good\"? Real love opens the fingers and lets the other person breathe freely inside it.",
    "symbolReading": "The Queen sits on a stone seat at the water's edge, and her cup is unlike any other — closed with a lid, guarding the deepest emotional secrets. Her feet are in the water, directly connected to the sea of feeling, her robe moving like waves. Water within water gives her that precision of intuition, and also means her boundaries dissolve most easily.",
    "jungianAnalysis": "The deep-sea queen is emotional intelligence at its height, able to read what is never said. Her shadow turns love into a thread that pulls — Chicory's possessiveness makes \"I care about you\" into \"you owe me\". The discipline of individuation is learning to give unconditionally and then truly let go, keeping no hidden ledger of love.",
    "flowerSpectrum": "When you give a great deal while quietly expecting something back, and can't stop managing the details of a loved one's life, Chicory keeps you company as the gripping hand opens, and you discover real abundance comes from flow that asks nothing.",
    "step1Status": "You may be pouring effort into someone, saying you want nothing back while an invisible ledger inside records every neglect and every thank-you.",
    "step2Allow": "I allow my love to move freely; no receipt required.",
