    "dailyPractice": "Practise one quiet act of love today — do something small for someone without telling them, hinting, or waiting for thanks. Afterwards, say to yourself: this love was complete the moment it was given.",
    "awarenessNote": "Awareness is like snorkelling — you can see the coral and the fish and you don't have to catch them and carry them ashore. Love is the same: see it, admire it, then let it go on swimming freely. That's the most beautiful relationship there is.",
