    "dailyPractice": "Give yourself thirty minutes entirely alone today — no phone, no music, no conversation. Just be quietly with yourself, and notice what surfaces in that silence.",
    "awarenessNote": "Awareness is like putting on headphones in a noisy café — with nothing playing in them, only your own breathing. Once the outside noise is filtered, you find the inner voice has been there all along, gentle and complete.",
