    "dailyPractice": "Write a letter you'll never send, to the person or situation that hurt you. Say everything, without politeness or reasoning. Read it once, then tear it up or burn it. Let those words leave your body.",
    "awarenessNote": "Heartbreak is like a stone split open — from outside it's simply broken, and looking into the split you may find crystal inside. Not every heartbreak shows you crystal, and every heartbreak makes the heart more spacious. The cracks that hurt so much will one day be the paths the light takes in.",
